ce":"Sun Radiance","source_tag":"_t","target":"日光"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"069652ac5374f4efebc2951e769293d7fbb880a12d39eca6c1a855a3880444c2","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c6aea5550129d36f155496bd2c71175d6e3a276360bcaf74a93e4571392a426d","logical_entry_identity":"c796aedb788f2ef2dfe5e3c61088b610c940d08de7efb5b38a18ab08829bcd71","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Market Stall","source_tag":"_t","target":"市场摊位"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c847f1520d9375802d5b7740c22b446468072f19308463ec1dbb64852baf766b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c6e986c5632fb6c4ac43c583132f74cec47cfc0686c5e4e5a7881a1138e97c19","logical_entry_identity":"2e5e8ce204134bf6aa157a7f729b3a1ab76157cdea395d8026b06c1538f98cdb","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Target# is less focused.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#不再集中精力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"934514a921e34fc69834903c96816e760633667bad97a09ca3c76ecb33d606ec","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c6f9a98b8cf110ebc26bf1fe344c279fadac7328740426cdd53114cf1fbc723d","logical_entry_identity":"3ec22b67614f5d11f9ce0dfb9beaaa529f77bab96f0aef803cf7dd840bc6f8b7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#Source# recoils from the shot.","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#被反冲力击退。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21256b3db90c8bf6c3a4c394f037bf8b1debd7240f2dbea456511dc24765b908","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c6fc753a349be5a2a130ceffab1d2092af76a60046d0e4a2a38051cb86efbfed","logical_entry_identity":"2a43c02cbfe2cc9ac57b028f1aa1e54b688f4f52bcdcf9e03691277708b17b3f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#PURPLE#You kick and destroy the valve!","source_tag":"log","target":"#PURPLE#你踢坏了阀门！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"556523389113c7c3b0b7f90127d720d7f5cc7496657ce347ea0fa1837846f2a6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c75f3d3e29577bdd7728386236fa6ef19f0af1c8bff0bfa593d4a6db41f27bbc","logical_entry_identity":"37fafc6a31022c0ff35606fae3fb63201d28d8a407fa953edffb22cb9537e1a6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Melding psionics with steamtech you create 5 mind drones at your sides that fly towards your target.\n\t\tIf they encounter a creature they will latch on it and bore into its skull for 6 turns, disrupting its thoughts.\n\t\tDisrupted creatures have %d%% chances to fail to use talents and suffer a -%d%% reduction to fear and sleep immunity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"将灵能和蒸汽科技结合，你在身边制造 5 只精神雄蜂飞向目标。\n\t\t雄蜂接触到生物时，将进入其大脑 6 回合，干扰思考能力。\n\t\t受影响的生物有 %d%% 几率使用技能失败，同时恐惧和睡眠免疫减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b75304bcec2009a9ea4a4aae5a7831d54e8636794ff86d91b45caa28217b233","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c76b22f780189637b63400f6a045b4ec2d8d1322fd1419abda7a1d0d54b3ae0a","logical_entry_identity":"c0f0457e726cbc998308b8d9d9abad88b64f5e4d51c377e07511d6b51ad02b5b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"spell","source_tag":"talent category","target":"法术"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bfbc47e29ead44aa4214292a0a2dcab8279b48051a4dccb61fc04961e624b78c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c7bba7d6986684b87c38b2442aea3ea067910f8108604250f2ff51782a36c600","logical_entry_identity":"ddb69318932ee6ec84200a15bb0391d4028fc75607c7ed3824bcddbfb9a0eda9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Using your arcane power you force galvanic rods to linger for %d turns. While lingering they are inert, but can link up to other rods.\n\t\tWhen two rods are present in range %d of one another they link with a galvanic beam.\n\t\tWhen three rods are present in range %d of one another they link with a triangular galvanic zone.\n\t\tAny creature caught in a galvanic beam or zone take %0.2f galvanic damage per turn.\n\t\tYou can maintain at most 3 rods.\n\t\tAt level 3 all affected creatures are shocked, reducing their stun and pin resistances by half.\n\t\tAt level 5 your weapon (if metallic, or embedded with a metallic tinker) acts as a rod that does not count towards your maximum.\n\t\tThis spell has 15%% chance to try to activate Hurricane, if used.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用奥术能量来让放电柱额外停留 %d 回合。停留的放电柱不会活动，但是可以和其他放电柱建立链接。\n\t\t如果在 %d 码范围内有两枚放电柱，它们会链接起来，形成一条放电射线。\n\t\t如果在 %d 码范围内有三枚放电柱，它们会链接起来，形成一个三角形的放电领域。\n\t\t任何被放电射线或放电领域击中的生物都会每回合受到 %0.2f 放电伤害。\n\t\t你最多同时释放三枚放电柱。\n\t\t技能等级 3 时，所有被影响的生物会被震撼，使他们的震慑和定身抗性减半。\n\t\t技能等级 5 时，你的金属武器，或是装载了金属插件的武器，可以作为一个放电柱使用，该放电柱不计入你的放电柱总量。\n\t\t这一法术有 15%% 的几率触发风暴之怒。\n\t\t技能伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"387fe4acade9d11d371a2ee971a22dca31b875f18437e3f2ecdc41bf9afc5670","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c7bfb0270e49833e5a56ee5b1b1a42cc63ea2b862e837a8a0d98070744fe343d","logical_entry_identity":"46153b44071c3a45ad4b103971ae11d6a555a0b2a7838f5f65dc2572a20f033d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"-Overcharge Saws","source_tag":"_t","target":"-链锯过载"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"682212250f4b559647eefdabc7c6fa59f0fadaa466010b217dec3bd94a67cb1d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c7cb9474dff24f466678202c4c76b1466103c9091baa48894110029155418626","logical_entry_identity":"449d38b9ca51a06f601678bd70bcae7002bb0d2f505f261f064946d04e347967","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Using large amounts of arcane power you create a supercharged Unstable Blast in your rods.\n\t\tThe extra energy is briefly converted to a huge mass, pulling in all creatures (but you) in range %d of any rod towards the center of the galvanic field.\n\t\tCan only be used with a triangular field is setup.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你使用大量的奥术能量，在你的放电柱中造成一股超载的不稳定爆破。\n\t\t额外的能量将会被转化成巨大的质量，将在任何放电柱 %d 码范围内所有的生物（不包括你）拖向放电领域的中央。\n\t\t只能在激活了一个三角放电领域的时候才可以使用。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a289f93f9b61dc632a0e35c1795b6ce0c7f3327e9c81a6539652e30614cab7d6","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c7e7cf417ed43a562ca2a77726c70944b481a9bb2df0684cea2fd98cc3c5d9aa","logical_entry_identity":"69c1e95bfc6258043ab709dafed860bc893633a5193759a56180367a66b436b0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Increases steampower by %d and steam crit by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"获得 %d 蒸汽强度和 %d%% 蒸汽技能暴击率。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"81ff3878b491baf89cdfbb8e8bc7da555d7062b90710fce39f33d818eb42e5a3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c7fcf126c52b9d1c8cdbeee97379b18aaeba8a9324f963b658b59dda6ddeec2b","logical_entry_identity":"51d75fb9162bcb6af7ea1e2d8c538f2737791fe38a1b03c8893b7e3e9988748a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Allows the use of Technomancy spells.\n\t\tGrants a magical steam reserve that regenerates %d steam per 10 mana spent.\n\t\tGrants Spellpower based on current steam level (currently %d; %d%% steam filled).\n\t\tOutside of combat, you relax and let your steam reserve slowly wither away.\n\t\t#{italic}#Metal Arcane Power!#{normal}#","source_tag":"tformat","target":"允许使用科技法术，\n\t\t获得一个魔法的蒸汽储备，每消耗10点法力值获得 %d 蒸汽。\n\t\t根据当前蒸汽等级获得法术强度（目前 %d；充满了 %d%% 蒸汽）\n\t\t在战斗外，你放松了控制，蒸汽储备会逐渐消退。\n\t\t#{italic}#金属奥术力量！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b7a92e74dab450131f343a43ef13fead3f455d0b508b8ff1befa6f82cff81e39","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c804a1fc18abbe0a34c151440fe967c9f049a7aa6c483f4420fadc7f31333e22","logical_entry_identity":"cc680cbf8390b7e7d7178a170ee115a38b80c9d914bed24e322efa118bb62356","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"- bleeding immunity","source_tag":"_t","target":"- 流血免疫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3a5c48aa62400da9d1b0507937840c36ae973e01197edc88078ec0cb9fded126","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c806226886149f307a32600e06c8da7516b2005713721e91ffcc5e87e89a00d0","logical_entry_identity":"cc2aeb41d1839b1023d75030db534f2a70e9b311c79cc8071f6f87219e12024a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"steamtech","source_tag":"_t","target":"蒸汽科技"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b2116c9c91e5b5a61d92ab7f37aef0bc04f6483ab3190e2cd68bd3909eae6fbf","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c80fd885b0c3271d6f9c5a95c5baa9b09e0a68e69cae9025f4719061d864aa14","logical_entry_identity":"440f31b55abdbf045b9a346d96d93724c56adcf82a28063276629fab118b942b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You think you can climb this tree if you want.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你可以攀登这棵树。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a2ae03f5132fedf02448080c2fdbe2d68d2381e309474e15f7cf3cab514f7e67","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c822498ad8db6bdc13f1500538d5866c9d02a1b9c0b3467c45598ee457bb210d","logical_entry_identity":"101648f8b56327d33e0edd99126c13b7870a496d24db1bae60e31ff681349d50","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"salve","source_tag":"_t","target":"药剂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"314a79214eadba07db576ef36ffca38ec9f971e754eb10635f72bd62f865d3e7","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c826c1f25f7f9aa79424d750982756a166de8325e5fca05ea16cfe04f842a662","logical_entry_identity":"32c5aa6e03e419becfeb9ec0c730d3e7b7f6271111e4f72bfb5a0f33bdfdad7e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You require a steamgun and an active miasma cloud for this talent.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要一把蒸汽枪和一个活跃的瘴气云雾才能使用这一技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c885b79fa19a5ebb9ce9fbac8b223c0837ce28fd4f368fd1f0adde72d6d9c4ba","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c83818a00b0fdf2b7b16a436de354ba83666221b7bcf4ceb1f3e8ac42b40cc67","logical_entry_identity":"9974a8dadec4015e3435182b82a5ebef607066ad68f334b1d433e4d4c9722253","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"%s resists the net.","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了束网。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ebf2c81262814dd8795ab6157662c639c774cea3d77eae407f816126baed8c02","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c83820b9b6d9f940e8dbbc506baf9cb4ffca87c3191cd319feecf206f43bb607","logical_entry_identity":"741c2a71320f1871d47f7e0e24ecfa3144a0600db7883568649dc2fddb28c0fd","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"a warning sign","source_tag":"_t","target":"警告标牌"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c0e27970e50ab8814fb8c2f1e2eecb53023faf730bf8524c324627a7b054299c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c88fff17f5bb5f432bed6b279ec0e8f1b7a5cfda2c31b3a5a15c2ce5b3f42c48","logical_entry_identity":"201eb28f105ad5c9b5e3b1e169b2f068597aa4128ae78408d3c7f9e86c5aeceb","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You need to activate Metatemporal Spinner to cast this spell.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要开启相位旋转才能释放这一法术。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"591386e6c46a7c3ae0038825accb107998697f8f8a1b40febda7d2a7f8a0de6f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c89728f7967c6261e7704e16c47c5e24e0ad96998ae5d5a5441d4411facfea84","logical_entry_identity":"a9837cd1cac04615aca528597623163d5f0a326e1c013e1aa754d1e1b74e640b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Steam Giant Airship","source_tag":"_t","target":"蒸汽巨人飞船"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf504a40c41986429ae93e5e126f371f166ecaea5e7388350096a45566b5021b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c89c3faf6b2a31e460fad836aeeb2f293a205c2b57287319c3d5cc7c07713ce8","logical_entry_identity":"5e29e4f3593e24f8bff714e3833bad685e2417b9e1f6bca2a7884cf9ab0f23b8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Physical save reduced by %d, armour and defense by %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"物理豁免下降 %d，护甲和闪避下降%d。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dafb78817462b511c38c53262318a0671b03342c53b3324bb28872a2615395a3","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c8a0b6d86f40b8ce7deffabc2dd5f8c8c6699ae531552384c6270505b99eab7a","logical_entry_identity":"a6ad0875b56b8080e447f6322d6f2edc743fba24f0cd4e4fc937c6fed70767c7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The Lumberator","source_tag":"entity name","target":"播种机"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d4c0ae779d2f7c61c1c6e964f9da060b1b370841cbdf785621c41920155f5729","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c8bb77ca52d439517e64a3d962e9c97734f6698a1dd786a4517dfae60ad333b3","logical_entry_identity":"462605f035cf3b9ab0df86c15cf5d4408e8aa2d9097f0654ce9667ae18abbc2b","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"As you descend the stairway down, you find yourself faced with what appears to be a solid wall of stone, a natural dead-end in a cave.  You start to turn around and walk back up, when you hear a crescendo of cracking and rumbling behind you; you turn back and see the stone falling away, revealing a smooth, white door, which promptly slides into the floor.  The doorway leads to a white hallway of indeterminate construction; rather than having fixed lighting, every square inch of the walls, floors, and ceiling slowly illuminates to a comfortable (if slightly teal-tinged) glow.  It should be beautiful, clean, peaceful, and serene...  and yet your instincts are screaming at you to get out as soon as you can and forget what you've seen here.  A few open panels on the walls reveal an assortment of inscrutable machinery, incorporating a variety of unidentifiable magical and psionic artifacts, yet one appears to be a sort of crushing device made with steam-tech, an invention that is surely newer than these ruins...  the crushing device abruptly activates when you ponder it, pressing minerals into a freshly-formed mindstar-like crystal.  A voice, one that should be soothing but disturbs you on a deeper level than you can translate into conscious thought, enters your mind as the crystal flickers:\n\n\"Welcome, %s.  We've been expecting you.  Unfortunately, we can't join you, but we can assure you that what lies ahead can only help you in your quests.  The door will seal behind you to ensure your safety, and reopen the moment you want to leave.  Come.  Learn, discover, and realize how our plans are advantageous to both of us.\"\n\nWell...  that isn't terribly reassuring.  You hesitantly step forward, expecting a trap and ready to turn around and bolt at a moment's notice--\n\nThe floor disappears from under you, and yet after falling only an inch, you suddenly feel weightless.  You turn; the freshly-formed mindstar, already beginning to crack, is glowing intensely.  \"We know that isn't terribly reassuring.  We don't care if you WERE expecting a trap, and if we truly wanted to kill you, bolting at a moment's notice wouldn't be fast enough.  In fact, it'd be very easy indeed.\"  You are abruptly thrown near the bottom of the pit towards a series of spikes by telekinetic force, then stop, held motionless inches above them.  \"Clearly, we don't want you dead or even slightly harmed,\" the voice from inside your head says, as the spikes retract into the pit floor and you slowly levitate back into the illuminated halls.  \"Now that we've established that...  let us help you.\"  You float to the top, and find yourself standing on solid ground as the floor rematerializes under you and the telekinetic force vanishes, moments before the mindstar shatters.\n\nNonetheless, you feel you shouldn't be here.  The fact that this place exists at all feels...  wrong.\n","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你拾阶而下，发现自己面前是一堵坚实的石墙，看上去是洞穴到了尽头。你开始转头往上走，突然听到身后逐渐增强的破裂声和隆隆声；你转身，发现石头脱落了，眼前出现一个光滑的白色门，迅速地滑入地板。门通向一个建筑风格难以识别的白色大堂；这里没有照明的灯具，每一寸墙、地板和天花板都缓慢由暗到亮地发光，直到光照变成了令人舒适的青绿色为止。这里的景象的确是美丽、洁净、平和而静谧的……然而你的本能在向你尖叫，让你从这离开，越快越好，然后忘掉你在这看过的东西。墙上有几个露出的操作板显示出这里有不少令人难以理解的机器，装有好几种难以分辨的魔法和灵能古物，不过有一个看上去是蒸汽科技做成的粉碎设备，比其他远古遗迹绝对要新的多……当你对着它深思时，粉碎设备突然启动了，把矿物压成一块新的灵晶般的水晶。在水晶开始闪烁时，有个声音进入了你的心灵，有着舒缓的语调，但令你在思维的深处感到不安，却也无法有意识地说出到底是什么原因：\n\n“欢迎你，%s。我们一直在等你。不幸的是，我们不能与你同行，但我们可以保证你前方的事物只会帮助你完成你的任务。后面的门会封上以保证你的安全，在你想离开时打开。来吧。学习，探索，发觉并意识到，我们的计划对双方都有利。”\n\n嗯……这看上去并不怎么可靠。你犹豫地往前走了一步，准备好应对一个陷阱，并准备好立即转头溜走————\n\n你脚下的地板消失了，虽然仅仅落下了一英寸，你突然感到失重了。你回头；那个刚形成的灵晶，已经开始碎裂了，发出着强烈的光。“我们知道那确实不怎么让人安心。我们不在乎你之前觉得会有陷阱，而且我们如果真想杀你，即使顷刻间溜走也不够快。事实上，杀你很简单。”你突然被念动力扔往坑底，到了一块尖刺上方，停了下来，悬在尖刺上方几英寸。“显然，我们不想让你死，甚至不想让你伤到一点皮毛，”头脑里的声音说道，同时尖刺收缩起来，你被缓缓抬升到被点亮的大堂里。“现在我们的关系确立了……让我们来帮你吧。”你浮到顶，地板重新物质化，念动力消失，你发现自己又站在坚实的地面上，片刻，灵晶破碎了。\n\n尽管如此，你觉得自己不该在这里。这个地方存在的事实总觉得是……错误的。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0e95aa44fb347be66aebac45a928635c254f4758e7bb65568f49a8b869dfb0cd","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c904c738bcc6b7f6165f62f9e7533b9f4536fcb6eb2c87cebb415d42d4b7aea5","logical_entry_identity":"d9f818838c57e9b9f66ce268e161df232ed6751e562d83dd7235b548b009d2f1","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The pinnacle of steamsaws technology. Every one of your hits will unleash the power of the storm onto your foes, chaining between them and stunning them!","source_tag":"_t","target":"蒸汽链锯技术的巅峰之作。你的每一击将会在敌人的身上施放风暴的力量，在他们的身上连锁并震慑他们！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f09272a445c5ed82bf2107fd57ae68bc46246ed06b6c4d14242bcc26f073fb7","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c9383fcf27842d54b618c171a82e1d78a08c788069b855625e0b854cf0fcfeb8","logical_entry_identity":"3713e57d512db08741d0d3430290e6626bdf3bead36c6197f28666b8f6ab1099","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have collapsed the tunnel, saving the Pride. For now.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你成功炸毁了隧道，挽救了部落的燃眉之急。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"21fbaddaed19fba5b764fafebeacb04adc175168452cc4e818217a66d6572dd1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c945789a3301f34c86e163f3ee59812ad7cb7017a174a523c89f79710dc4eb61","logical_entry_identity":"7cc0ac0f2e0448f2d44b1b55cf0a6bae9cf3eeb3bd85a934a32f1334c7b3d49e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Skin Color 8","source_tag":"_t","target":"皮肤颜色8"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0530c4aae14acb7e45823b45c72d17a7054c96eeeeea438915884a8d493d8c7e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c94f27c08be0fa362b1f544a6b707dfc175e51639cc73af6953cc5c0ab3f0c30","logical_entry_identity":"c5c2e7c78503e0e093a5c76e805e4d6fdbd3c416d852082513bc86e8c432f07c","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* The impressive Automated Defense System remains will prove very useful to create automated and self-deploying constructs.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 这种令人印象深刻的自动防御系统的残骸，对制造可以自动部署的自动化机械十分有用。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bad5e66b1e643dc92090529322c8b64d5c28e224d2c16a6a59f7d4d621402729","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c960afa6d3e66548b6ae59c639e199b848e1571fbb2ea92b8136db60566a30c2","logical_entry_identity":"2fdaeb3299b6b321962e09aefb80e821953c0fe72e02ff2f71145a540d8e4a6d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Goresplosion","source_tag":"talent name","target":"爆尸"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8f5e6545e425a844cacb7eaa8373cf05cdc1061a1d57e305086623dca57804ae","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c96c499dc6a25950186930888267f0ec6ea887bba1ba58d84d04a48f1436d28e","logical_entry_identity":"6cd0e713da29162086e99108527f80dbec694c9525fe8267fc68677bef70d50f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Spiderbot Shield","source_tag":"talent name","target":"蜘蛛机器人护盾"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b01c513d3bcd5975f8f059df392cc0aea974b9f3cb0c37a8f158cc061f952228","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c9c5147c91a2252a679e7e0150153dec8a1c25d09b18f8b79b2f67f18b346ec0","logical_entry_identity":"d8085f727c26f127d91d8eade1f449be12118e8326302bad1bacc55535490d1e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"shattered mindstar","source_tag":"_t","target":"破碎的灵晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5937f3ddefceef69d016796cd9211ba967a8cc5a92c77b0dcc65dbaa485c36db","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c9d0e0bae7a9be4f91c761790095ab405805572f7201e44c5a551a0f17d274f1","logical_entry_identity":"b092765f28d6ecb5b5def67f747576486cde4030f2c56a20af1dde713b1d82f0","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"The machine gives you a small metallic box labelled as #{italic}#\"Automated Portable Extractor\"#{normal}#.\nIt seems to be used to break down metallic items into lumps of metal and infusions into herbs which are used to craft tinkers.\n\n#{bold}#You will have to choose to use it or the Transmogrification Chest when you destroy items. You can choose the default one by using it with no items to destroy.#{normal}#\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"机械交给你一个小金属盒，上面写着 #{italic}#\"便携式自动提取仪\"#{normal}#。\n它似乎能将金属物品转化为铁块，将纹身转化为植物。\n\n#{bold}#你可以选择使用它或者转化之盒。在里面没有物品时使用它则设置为默认使用。#{normal}#\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3ea67e87b1a04a286d7e15c9e02a776089d03ce277866774c156d21a1d7a17d0","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c9e4f8faa8062cb771b773ccc7cc7971ea9a7da058dad1b88fe90a09b5a29320","logical_entry_identity":"c09e3609a8e8381e030cce0b8a316497a7e400f7d551d0e4527c6ea977496064","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Glacia","source_tag":"entity name","target":"冰川"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3625e38591e3ff887e2e1a253df5ee63f960b47b7dcd8178674d2f3b890935f4","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"c9fe95d01a4facae99a077c73c8166ee12de4d184af799edceb4337e8d0fff8e","logical_entry_identity":"19df047bc39139785253b67d2f9879a64f431c6f4f3dab3bd1fa47c62b764ec6","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"interlocked steamsaws","source_tag":"_t","target":"连锁在一起的蒸汽链锯"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4bb5af6b753ad055cc4328a6046e5fdeee68a531de4a2d1b6c4e20555c64bf8a","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca0914e806064b1ae12495bce76ccecfb16c9964607d3951dd406ed003439feb","logical_entry_identity":"49bd474172192ac1b4f2f6121b5c6272a9e00872df33f74e7628e9dd01af0ce9","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Yeti Mind Controller","source_tag":"entity name","target":"雪人精神控制仪"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6aa82f42c3996462c354f9f871bb2982e3553b4cc7d73d22451d1ec3acedc3ca","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca0a8cb050ca26ebb38fef21d6d2af612749ae91afc2071505aa49aa91818907","logical_entry_identity":"40822d983c4bec4f307ef045707c4f041b4f5c1034a588bffd7cac1477f611a5","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Smith","source_tag":"talent name","target":"铁匠"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c65424d79265d27cd47911147ac6c3a9d7297d73f4bf86008dceca76946c233d","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca1073c0da0b3691e547b5a595b28827c80bf1b9bb89a6a1fd9cb8d2808d052c","logical_entry_identity":"da3fc8299138414c31368df1b74630ad51a12d4d1a9df2059ed6a983faa01a78","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Upgrade","source_tag":"talent name","target":"炮台升级"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a3555c9003e0f27dafb4df747c4b232d5c1871daae0588936cb189c462f2944c","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca1e05972a3e6f98abe53badf703af600e21a211a352e04288f71107423cef64","logical_entry_identity":"9d78c9e61600d7335d25bb7d7e62e5d80f6be50452d0fdd678a6f11f16f3d727","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"citrine","source_tag":"_t","target":"黄水晶"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c19a2eddb9f9f15497aa55923209c2ae8348669fc7e2280c74f6d4472041739b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca5e06ad7727364a8c2e5002564eb17c73010ffc4c0c0deedf5c79ee90573739","logical_entry_identity":"8fcdfa808a31a5e57134ea6b838e628c9e16e19874417c75d1d01ff4e7c1f44a","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"As Kaltor falls you quickly grab a big golden key from his waist. Surely this opens the chests.","source_tag":"_t","target":"卡托尔倒下时，你迅速从他腰间取走了一把巨大的黄金钥匙。显然这能打开他的宝箱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c1095145c1a31777ba736c570e4d7f5e33184f8719b809708cca1dcff8e75a95","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca5f144f18d6ce262c522d361e058d6da2f8b34afa5343d17850ee3cad982d63","logical_entry_identity":"a714f64f5fd4630e73f526905220b0828c7177e7f39da77a578077d929dc4bbb","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Corrosive Shell","source_tag":"talent name","target":"腐蚀弹"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a17e2b87c668e8a16e8d9754ce1302c3afabb085d72ed5a7c0f6b232c17f5876","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca6c339044ca1745c34a1c064bb4cb8862c87053b3df07f47d8b714e42fcf5e9","logical_entry_identity":"e1d3ed47cb17456878141e1aeb57f0c4e031f28cbed7c6b684eb83253af45be8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Command a random spiderbot to jump onto your target at ramming speed. The impact destroys the bot (possibly triggering Cryogenic Digs).\n\t\tThis creates a radius %d explosion dealing %0.2f terrene damage to all creatures while also freezing them for %d turns and rendering them wet for %d turns.\n\t\tThe cooldown of this spell is affected by Body of Stone.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"命令一个随机的蜘蛛机器人以冲撞速度跃向目标。撞击会摧毁机器人（可能触发低温掘进）。\n\t\t这会产生半径为 %d 的爆炸，对所有生物造成 %0.2f 寒岩伤害，同时将它们冻结 %d 回合并使其浸湿 %d 回合。\n\t\t此法术的冷却时间受岩石身躯影响。\n\t\t伤害随法术强度提高。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9dbc541bde229af25da0cb13c8d4f805efd350954b6bce701b8911bc66889f19","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca74ae8993cdc9b69209c09657a3ccb7b4aa6001e364dd9c1c8d4a8fc92ddb16","logical_entry_identity":"a68140d61f73ca26e5d0354a269917367ae4bc18fefd52d7747e8d49ac5cff88","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"-Itching Powder","source_tag":"_t","target":"-痒痒粉"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"08dd94f27ab7dfa11f5d38be490707e0b8ec45a5de4e68bfc84ac5c56fcb0b7e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca8142df20c8d228de8ad2855e39db2e9e3ad530061401b9f035f42983d9ab7f","logical_entry_identity":"9ef2bf2af0f2a629e92e218fdf79babd5c07eed7852d5f801e25da431fcbff0f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"summon a treant (5 turn cooldown)","source_tag":"_t","target":"召唤一个树人（5回合冷却）"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"266ecdb1b0af3510dfcb46c165b32b81e29be52a195e86175993ca1b6e38e177","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca844e34c236669e2f28b24e95b03d70bfa7e1cf9df7147a1d0770472ca3743a","logical_entry_identity":"020bae297f8b3d9e4a9556e2b6c2e7b4275bfcdb0a6fa63254be2e00fc23b56e","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Entrance to the Pride's Internment Camp","source_tag":"entity name","target":"部落拘留营入口"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"681a8dc8ac17e3551bce22c79e737e1601d47072280a85c806ab40f1d87f8809","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"ca8efef6ad4ac1ba0ab6b5b86dfafbe85438600ffacddb69fbea1ca71dc2ef49","logical_entry_identity":"86c6d3814901afdbad4fcb67f3413b45ee263952cd589e9079b11bf0780fa1b7","norma